#: imageeffect_texture.cpp:58 imageplugin_texture.cpp:62
msgid "Apply Texture"
msgstr "អនុវត្ត​វាយនភាព"

#: imageeffect_texture.cpp:60
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to apply a decorative texture to an image."
msgstr ""
"កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​រូបភាព​របស់ digiKam "
"ដើម្បី​អនុវត្ត​វាយនភាព​តុបតែង​​ទៅ​កាន់​​រូបភាព​មួយ ។"

#: imageeffect_texture.cpp:68
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "​អ្នក​និពន្ធ និង​អ្នក​ថែទាំ"

#: imageeffect_texture.cpp:71
msgid "Developer"
msgstr "អ្នក​អភិវឌ្ឍន៍"

#: imageeffect_texture.cpp:80
msgid "Type:"
msgstr "​ប្រភេទ ៖"

